{
  "_comment": [
    "THE CROSS-LANGUAGE ORACLE for the subcategory filter. ONE file, TWO readers:",
    "  - pytest  api/tests/test_jobs_search_filters.py (the SQL predicate)",
    "  - vitest  src/frontend/src/__tests__/features/filters/subcategoryFilterOracle.test.ts",
    "            (the client matcher used by the Companies page and demo mode)",
    "Same file read by both is the only mechanical way to assert the two agree.",
    "Neither side invents rows; both read whatever is committed here.",
    "The frontend reaches it with six '../' from src/frontend/src/__tests__/features/filters/,",
    "resolved absolutely via import.meta.url so it is cwd-independent."
  ],

  "expansion": {
    "frontend": ["frontend", "full_stack"],
    "backend": ["backend", "full_stack"]
  },
  "_expansion_comment": [
    "Keyed on the SELECTED slug and ONE-WAY: picking Frontend also matches Full",
    "Stack, but picking Full Stack stays exact. Asserted deep-equal against the",
    "backend's enrichment_writer.SUBCATEGORY_FILTER_EXPANSION and against the",
    "frontend's constants/enrichment.ts SUBCATEGORY_FILTER_EXPANSION."
  ],

  "source_id": "oracle_src",

  "jobs": [
    {
      "job_id": "o-null",
      "enrichment_category": "software_engineering",
      "enrichment_subcategories": null,
      "_why": "NEVER EVALUATED — the backfill queue. Hidden by any active filter."
    },
    {
      "job_id": "o-empty",
      "enrichment_category": "software_engineering",
      "enrichment_subcategories": [],
      "_why": "EVALUATED, no specialty applies. TERMINAL, and hidden just the same."
    },
    {
      "job_id": "o-backend",
      "enrichment_category": "software_engineering",
      "enrichment_subcategories": ["backend"]
    },
    {
      "job_id": "o-frontend",
      "enrichment_category": "software_engineering",
      "enrichment_subcategories": ["frontend"]
    },
    {
      "job_id": "o-full-stack",
      "enrichment_category": "software_engineering",
      "enrichment_subcategories": ["full_stack"],
      "_why": "Matched BY frontend and BY backend selections; matches full_stack too."
    },
    {
      "job_id": "o-backend-ai",
      "enrichment_category": "software_engineering",
      "enrichment_subcategories": ["backend", "ai_engineering"],
      "_why": "TWO slugs, primary first. The SECONDARY label counts for filtering."
    },
    {
      "job_id": "o-ai-primary",
      "enrichment_category": "software_engineering",
      "enrichment_subcategories": ["ai_engineering", "security"]
    },
    {
      "job_id": "o-security",
      "enrichment_category": "software_engineering",
      "enrichment_subcategories": ["security"]
    },
    {
      "job_id": "o-nonswe-backend",
      "enrichment_category": "growth",
      "enrichment_subcategories": ["backend"],
      "_why": [
        "A DECOY that should not exist in real data. It proves the subcategory",
        "predicate reads the ARRAY and nothing else — the category predicate is a",
        "separate condition that ANDs with it. Both languages must return it for a",
        "bare backend selection, and both must drop it once a category filter is",
        "also active."
      ]
    },
    {
      "job_id": "o-nonswe-null",
      "enrichment_category": "growth",
      "enrichment_subcategories": null
    }
  ],

  "selections": [
    {
      "name": "no selection shows everything",
      "subcategory": [],
      "expected": [
        "o-null",
        "o-empty",
        "o-backend",
        "o-frontend",
        "o-full-stack",
        "o-backend-ai",
        "o-ai-primary",
        "o-security",
        "o-nonswe-backend",
        "o-nonswe-null"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "backend widens into full_stack",
      "subcategory": ["backend"],
      "expected": ["o-backend", "o-full-stack", "o-backend-ai", "o-nonswe-backend"]
    },
    {
      "name": "frontend widens into full_stack",
      "subcategory": ["frontend"],
      "expected": ["o-frontend", "o-full-stack"]
    },
    {
      "name": "full_stack alone stays EXACT (one-way)",
      "subcategory": ["full_stack"],
      "expected": ["o-full-stack"]
    },
    {
      "name": "a secondary label counts",
      "subcategory": ["ai_engineering"],
      "expected": ["o-backend-ai", "o-ai-primary"]
    },
    {
      "name": "two values OR together, de-duplicating the overlap",
      "subcategory": ["frontend", "security"],
      "expected": ["o-frontend", "o-full-stack", "o-ai-primary", "o-security"]
    },
    {
      "name": "frontend and backend together yield full_stack exactly once",
      "subcategory": ["frontend", "backend"],
      "expected": [
        "o-backend",
        "o-frontend",
        "o-full-stack",
        "o-backend-ai",
        "o-nonswe-backend"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "a well-formed UNKNOWN slug matches nothing without erroring",
      "subcategory": ["ai_ml"],
      "expected": []
    }
  ],

  "category_composition": [
    {
      "name": "category AND subcategory compose — the decoy drops out",
      "category": ["software_engineering"],
      "subcategory": ["backend"],
      "expected": ["o-backend", "o-full-stack", "o-backend-ai"]
    },
    {
      "name": "a non-SWE category with a SWE subcategory returns nothing",
      "category": ["growth"],
      "subcategory": ["frontend"],
      "expected": []
    }
  ]
}
